# eval-types evaluates multiple expressions in type-stage environment.
# Parsing "[x: 1] [y: 2]" produces a Program with one document containing
# two dict expressions. Returning parsed.program in output triggers the
# ValueNotSerializable error — Program values cannot be serialized to JSON.
[
  parsed: [builtin-parse [builtin-str-bytes "[x: 1] [y: 2]"] "test.llt"]
  parsed.program
]

=== error
cannot serialize Program to JSON
